# Butler Routes - Teldrassil recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes whose SOURCE is physically in Teldrassil, verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item and vendor tables). Six Cooking
# recipes are sold by the zone's own vendors in Dolanaar and Rut'theran. The
# Darnassus-city vendors (Ulthir, Elynna, Saenorion, Vaean, Mythrin'dir, Fyldan)
# also show Teldrassil-zone spawns, but they spawn on the Darnassus city map
# 1457 as well — per the Teldrassil census city rule they are Darnassus sources,
# not Teldrassil ones, so none of their recipes ships here. Every dropped recipe
# with any Teldrassil source also drops elsewhere (generic world drops), and
# quest records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/teldrassil-recipes
title Teldrassil - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-10
zone Teldrassil
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords teldrassil, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Dolanaar (Nyoma)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 4265 -- Nyoma (57.19, 61.26)
  buy 6325 "Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish"
  buy 6328 "Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper"
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish"
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — Rut'theran (Nessa Shadowsong)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 10118 -- Nessa Shadowsong (56.26, 92.44)
  buy 6326 "Recipe: Slitherskin Mackerel"
  buy 6368 "Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
